Subject: Welcome to Klai, you're in
<p>Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p>You made it. We're glad you're here.</p>
<p>You're one of the first 100 companies on Klai. We started Klai because most AI tools are built for teams with the biggest servers and the deepest pockets. Smaller European companies do real work too, often on data that cannot leave Europe. So we're building for that work.</p>
<p>The private beta opens slowly because we want it to land well, not just look good on a launch graph. One of us will reach out personally to walk you through setup.</p>
<p>Talk soon,<br>Jantine, Mark &amp; Steven<br>Founders of Klai</p>
